# ── Phase C / C-20: media git budget ──────────────────────────────────────
# Full local corpus (~520 trees) is artifact/local only — NOT the CDN.
# Rebuild: python scripts/precompute_species_images.py --all
# Priority stubs: python scripts/precompute_species_images.py --force-stubs --priority-only
# Audit: python scripts/audit_media.py --priority --fail-priority
# Priority slug list (committed): media/manifests/priority_slugs_v1.json
# Keep only fixtures committed for CI smoke (real photos stay local/artifact).
media/species/**
